              "number": 111,
              "code": "Time-out Timer"
            },
            "description": "Ends a transmission that stays keyed longer than this. The steps run from 0.5 minutes to 5.0 minutes in half-minute steps, then 10 minutes. Clone images confirm index 0x09 is 5.0 min and 0x0A is 10 min, which matches this list."
          }
        }
