            "label": "SSB High Cut",
            "widget": "select",
            "menu": {
              "number": 120,
              "code": "SSB High Cut"
            },
            "description": "SSB receive high-cut frequency. Clone images confirm 0x01 = 2.4 kHz, 0x02 = 2.6 kHz, and 0x04 = 3.0 kHz. The manual lists 2.2, 2.4, 2.6, 2.8, and 3.0 kHz. Those confirmed bytes are 0.2 kHz steps, so 0x00 = 2.2 kHz and 0x03 = 2.8 kHz are inferred."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scanResume",
