            "group": "scan",
            "subgroup": "resume",
            "label": "Scan Resume",
            "widget": "select",
            "menu": {
              "number": 130,
              "code": "Resume"
            },
            "description": "What analog scan does after it stops on a signal. Time resumes after the restart timer. Carrier resumes when the signal drops. Seek stops and stays. Digital scan resume is a separate menu and is not this setting."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
