            "group": "cw",
            "subgroup": "pitch",
            "label": "CW Pitch",
            "widget": "select",
            "menu": {
              "number": 170,
              "code": "Pitch Frequency"
            },
            "description": "CW sidetone pitch. Clone images confirm 0x04 = 800 Hz and 0x06 = 1000 Hz. The step between those bytes is 100 Hz. The manual range is 400 to 1000 Hz, so 0x00 = 400 Hz and the unmeasured steps 500, 600, 700, and 900 Hz are inferred."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
